mods/daijisho-wallpapers/xbox.png is drawn on the placeholder wallpaper of
the "BB-1 Dark" pack by BrunoBelmonte, from Daijishou
(https://github.com/TapiocaFox/Daijishou), Copyright (c) 2022 TapiocaFox
(Yves Chen), MIT License. It also uses the title picture of Second Reality
by Future Crew (https://github.com/mtuomi/SecondReality), as captured by
the Xbox port (https://github.com/kooscode/SecondReality), both released
under the Unlicense.

With ES-DE, the build includes MAGISK_ES-DE_fix.zip from GammaOS Next
(https://github.com/TheGammaSqueeze/GammaOSNext), unchanged, Copyright
TheGammaSqueeze, Apache License 2.0.

On the 1.4.4 base, the build downloads and includes the Colorful (Simplified)
theme for ES-DE (https://github.com/anthonycaccese/colorful-simplified-es-de)
by ant, based on the Colorful theme by viking and faeran, under the Creative
Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 2.0 license; its README, with
the full credits, is installed with it.

The build downloads platform wallpapers for Daijisho from the same "BB-1 Dark"
pack (Daijishou, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 TapiocaFox (Yves Chen));
they show artwork from the games and consoles they represent, which belongs
to its respective owners.

The build downloads C-BIOS 0.29a (https://cbios.sourceforge.net/) and installs
its MSX, MSX2 and MSX2+ machines for RetroArch's blueMSX core, with its license
